1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:13,140
What was Frank's first job?
弗兰克的第一份工作是什么？

2
00:00:13,140 --> 00:00:15,950
What was Frank's first job?
弗兰克的第一份工作是什么？

3
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,190
Yesterday afternoon
昨天下午

4
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:26,090
Frank Hawkins was telling me about his experiences as a young man.
弗兰克·霍金斯向我讲述了他年轻时的经历。

5
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:38,650
Before he retired, Frank was the head of a very large business company, but as a boy he used to work in a small shop.
退休前弗兰克是一家很大的商业公司的经理，但他小时候却在一家小店里做工。

6
00:00:39,670 --> 00:00:48,000
It was his job to repair bicycles and at that time he used to work fourteen hours a day.
他的工作是修理自行车，那时他每天要工作14个小时。

7
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:57,490
He saved money for years and in 1958 he bought a small workshop of his own.
他积攒了好几年的钱，1958年买下了自己的一个小车间。

8
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:04,550
In his twenties Frank used to make spare parts for aeroplanes.
二十多岁时，弗兰克曾生产飞机零件。

9
00:01:04,570 --> 00:01:08,400
At that time he had two helpers.
那时他有两个帮手。

10
00:01:09,680 --> 00:01:18,490
In a few years the small workshop had become a large factory which employed seven hundred and twenty-eight people.
几年后，小车间变成了雇有728人的大工厂。

11
00:01:19,980 --> 00:01:25,890
Frank smiled when he remembered his hard early years and the long road to success.
弗兰克回想起早年的艰辛和通往成功的漫长道路时笑了。

12
00:01:27,220 --> 00:01:31,570
He was still smiling when the door opened and his wife came in.
他还在微笑时，门开了，妻子走了进来。

13
00:01:32,510 --> 00:01:35,860
She wanted him to repair their grandson's bicycle!
她要他去修理孙子的自行车！
